      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It is potentially the same kind of bug as this Canny( https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/temporary-value-is-not-initialized-if-it-is-also-appears-in-unreached-path ) .\n\nIn the linked one, it's happening in a variable handling node via Branch.\n\nThe same thing happens when we merge the flow of Branch.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
